# SCENARIO: perceive_self   SEED: 0   CAMERAS: none   BOTCFG: off
# Own-character perception (perceive.lua) for actions whose server outcome is fixed by the server
# scripts, so every expected client delta has a known cause:
#  - Wound Cleansing `exura ico` (data/scripts/spells/healing/wound_cleansing.lua): knight lvl 8,
#    40 mana, CONST_ME_MAGIC_BLUE (13) on the caster, spell id 123 + healing-group cooldown 1 s.
#    At full HP the heal is 0, so no heal number is expected.
#  - Health potion 266 (data/scripts/actions/items/potions.lua): MAGIC_BLUE on the drinker,
#    "Aaaah..." potion bubble (static text), potion sound, one 266 consumed, empty flask 285 added
#    to the backpack (container delta).
#  - Login in the Thais temple: the PZ dove ('pz' in cond).
# MUTATES the harness character (mana spent, 1 potion, +1 flask, achievement kv): back up the
# players / player_items / kv_store rows of guid 70001 BEFORE running (see README).
@p1 login
@p1 sleep 2
@p1 perceive expect="tap=true"
@p1 self as=S0 expect="cond=[^ ]*pz"
@p1 open back
@p1 sleep 1
@srv expect src=cli:p1 k=see_self changed~="cont_" why~="containerOpen" min=1 within=5
@p1 self expect="266x10"
@p1 say exura ico
@p1 sleep 0.4
@p1 self expect="cd=123 "
@p1 sleep 1.5
@srv expect src=cli:p1 k=see_effect id=13 dx=0 dy=0 dz=0 min=1 within=8
@srv expect src=cli:p1 k=see_self d_mp=-40 min=1 within=8
@srv expect src=cli:p1 k=see_cooldown kind=spell id=123 ms=1000 min=1 within=8
@srv expect src=cli:p1 k=see_cooldown kind=group min=1 within=8
@srv expect src=cli:p1 k=see_sound min=1 within=8
@p1 say exura ico
@p1 sleep 2
@srv expect src=cli:p1 k=see_self d_mp=-40 min=2 within=15
@p1 use 266
@p1 sleep 2
@srv expect src=cli:p1 k=see_effect id=13 dx=0 dy=0 min=3 within=20
@srv expect src=cli:p1 k=see_text kind=static name="Harness One" text~="Aaaah" min=1 within=6
@srv expect src=cli:p1 k=see_self changed~="cont_" why~="container" min=1 within=6
@p1 self expect="266x9.*285|285.*266x9"
@p1 view
@p1 perceive expect="tap_errors=0"
@srv expect-none src=cli:p1 k=tap_error
@p1 logout
